{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"None of the DBS modalities yielded statistically significant improvements in FOG-Q scores (all 95% CIs crossed zero, p > 0.05).\",\n    \"The overall estimates indicate that, compared with the control group, none of the DBS interventions yielded statistically significant improvements in FOG-Q scores.\",\n    \"The results indicate that the 95% CIs for all interventions cross zero, and none of the p-values reached statistical significance (p > 0.05), suggesting that no DBS intervention demonstrated a reliable statistical effect in improving FOG-Q scores.\",\n    \"spDBS [MD = 18.06, 95% CI (10.42, 25.70), p < 0.0001] and STN-DBS [MD = 17.58, 95% CI (13.20, 21.95), p < 0.0001] provided the most pronounced improvements.\",\n    \"spDBS exhibited the most substantial therapeutic improvement [MD = 14.5369, 95% CI (7.1313; 21.9425), p = 0.0001]... STN-DBS [MD = 11.2475, 95% CI (4.4782; 18.0168), p = 0.0011] also demonstrated robust and clinically meaningful effects.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Third, leave-one-out sensitivity analysis was conducted by sequentially omitting each individual study to examine its influence on the overall effect estimate.\",\n    \"Forest plot of leave-one-out sensitivity analysis. Panel A presents the leave-one-out sensitivity analysis with MDS-UPDRS III as the outcome, Panel B presents the leave-one-out sensitivity analysis with FOG-Q score as the outcome, and Panel C presents the leave-one-out sensitivity analysis with Gait speed as the outcome.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的FOG-Q结论有明确的全文依据。摘要、FOG-Q主要结果部分均明确指出，11种DBS模式的网络Meta分析结果均未达到统计学显著性，置信区间均跨零。因此，不能仅凭指控者的描述认定报告误读了主要分析结果。此外，论文摘要与正文确实存在步速效应量差异：摘要报告spDBS和STN-DBS的MD分别为18.06和17.58，正文分别报告14.5369和11.2475，报告指出这一差异也有全文依据。对于指控者提出的敏感性分析矛盾，附件中确实说明实施了FOG-Q的leave-one-out敏感性分析，并且图7包含相应的Panel B。但是，附件可读取的全文内容仅提供了图7的说明，没有给出该Panel B中具体的效应量、置信区间或p值，也没有文字报告任何干预在敏感性分析中达到统计学显著性。因此，无法根据现有附件确认指控者所称的置信区间不跨零、p值小于0.05的相反结果。不能把敏感性分析的存在等同于其结果与主要分析相矛盾。最终判断：报告关于主要FOG-Q网络分析的说法有全文明确支持；指控者关于敏感性分析出现相反统计结果的说法，在附件可读取内容中无法核实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "35e1bf11-8e86-48b4-a183-63ca49d0a2b0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125319337179Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:54:25.471509+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "71ee176c3efb40fa6d1d78606bb3ab1bc5ee6f2dacaeca4f9054d9fe7518ce09", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125319337179Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256